---
import {
  messages,
  getDailyMessageIndex,
  getDaysSinceStart,
} from "../data/messages";

const index = getDailyMessageIndex();
const message = messages[index];
const dayNumber = getDaysSinceStart();

const today = new Date();
const dateStr = today.toLocaleDateString("es-MX", {
  weekday: "long",
  year: "numeric",
  month: "long",
  day: "numeric",
});
---

<article class="card-wrapper sunflower-glass">
  <div class="card-glow"></div>
  <header class="card-header">
    <div class="sunflower-icon" id="main-sunflower" aria-hidden="true">🌻</div>
    <p class="subtitle">campo de girasoles</p>
  </header>

  <div class="message-block">
    <blockquote class="message-text" id="daily-message-text">
      {message}
    </blockquote>
  </div>

  <footer class="card-footer">
    <div class="divider" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="divider-line"></span>
      <span class="divider-sun">☀️</span>
      <span class="divider-line"></span>
    </div>
    <p class="date-label">
      <time datetime={today.toISOString()} id="daily-date">{dateStr}</time>
    </p>
    {
      dayNumber > 0 && (
        <p class="day-counter" id="daily-counter-block">
          Día <strong id="daily-day-num">{dayNumber}</strong> floreciendo a tu
          lado
        </p>
      )
    }
    <p class="signature">Tu Ponsscito 🌻</p>
    <div class="button-group">
      <button id="bloom-btn" class="bloom-button">Hacer Florecer ✨</button>
      <button id="reasons-btn" class="bloom-button reasons-btn"
        >¿Por qué te amo?
      </button>
      <button id="special-msg-btn" class="special-link"
        >Nuestra promesa
      </button>
    </div>
  </footer>
</article>

<div id="reasons-overlay" class="reasons-overlay">
  <div class="reasons-content">
    <button id="close-reasons" class="close-button">×</button>
    <h2 class="reasons-title">¿Por qué te amo?</h2>
    <div class="reasons-scroll">
      <p>
        Te amo porque eres todo lo que me hace feliz, porque incluso en los días
        en los que nada parece tener sentido, tú logras cambiarlo todo con solo
        existir. Te amo porque te quedas, a pesar de mis problemas, de mis
        errores y de mis momentos difíciles, y aun así eliges estar conmigo.
      </p>
      <div class="reasons-separator">🌻</div>
      <p>
        Te amo porque desde que llegaste, la vida tiene un sentido diferente,
        más profundo, más real. Porque saber que existes me da paz, me da fuerza
        y me da razones para seguir adelante. Te amo porque cada momento que
        compartimos, por pequeño que sea, se queda guardado en mí como algo
        eterno.
      </p>
      <div class="reasons-separator">🌻</div>
      <p>
        Te amo porque, a pesar de la distancia, siempre te voy a escoger a ti,
        una y mil veces, sin dudarlo. Porque no importa cuánto tiempo pase o
        cuántos obstáculos haya, mi decisión siempre serás tú.
      </p>
      <div class="reasons-separator">🌻</div>
      <p>
        Te amo porque eres la mujer que siempre voy a querer en mi vida, porque
        en ti encontré algo que nunca había sentido antes. Te amo porque te
        volviste la razón de mi mundo, el motivo detrás de mis sonrisas y de mis
        ganas de seguir luchando.
      </p>
      <div class="reasons-separator">🌻</div>
      <p>
        Te amo porque incluso cuando todo pesa, cuando el mundo se siente
        difícil, pensar en ti me da fuerzas para no rendirme. Porque eres mi
        impulso, mi calma y mi lugar seguro al mismo tiempo.
      </p>
      <div class="reasons-separator">🌻</div>
      <p>
        Te amo porque no eres perfecta, pero eres perfecta para mí. Porque cada
        detalle tuyo, cada forma de ser, cada palabra, me hace quererte más.
      </p>
      <div class="reasons-separator">🌻</div>
      <p>
        Te amo porque contigo aprendí lo que realmente significa amar, sin
        condiciones, sin miedo, con todo el corazón.
      </p>
      <div class="reasons-separator">🌻</div>
      <p class="reasons-ending">Y te amo… simplemente porque eres tú. 💛</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="special-overlay" class="special-overlay">
  <div class="overlay-content">
    <button id="close-overlay" class="close-button">×</button>
    <p class="overlay-text">
      Cuando quieras podemos regresar y amarnos nuevamente, cada segundo de mi
      vida pienso en ti.❤️
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  import {
    messages,
    getDailyMessageIndex,
    getDaysSinceStart,
  } from "../data/messages";

  function updateContent() {
    const msgText = document.getElementById("daily-message-text");
    const dateEl = document.getElementById("daily-date");
    const dayNumEl = document.getElementById("daily-day-num");
    const counterBlock = document.getElementById("daily-counter-block");

    if (!msgText || !dateEl) return;

    const epoch = new Date(2026, 2, 23);
    const index = getDailyMessageIndex(epoch);
    const dayNumber = getDaysSinceStart(epoch);
    const today = new Date();

    function typeWriter(text: string, element: HTMLElement, delay = 40) {
      element.textContent = "";
      let i = 0;
      function type() {
        if (i < text.length) {
          element.textContent += text.charAt(i);
          i++;
          setTimeout(type, delay);
        }
      }
      type();
    }

    typeWriter(messages[index], msgText);

    dateEl.textContent = today.toLocaleDateString("es-MX", {
      weekday: "long",
      year: "numeric",
      month: "long",
      day: "numeric",
    });
    dateEl.setAttribute("datetime", today.toISOString());

    if (dayNumEl) {
      dayNumEl.textContent = dayNumber.toString();
    }

    const bloomBtn = document.getElementById("bloom-btn");
    if (bloomBtn) {
      bloomBtn.onclick = () => {
        const petals = ["🌻", "🌻", "🌻", "🍃", "🌿"];
        const totalParticles = 200;
        const batchSize = 20;
        let created = 0;

        const burstInterval = setInterval(() => {
          for (let i = 0; i < batchSize && created < totalParticles; i++) {
            const p = document.createElement("span");
            p.textContent = petals[Math.floor(Math.random() * petals.length)];
            p.className = "bloom-petal";

            const x = Math.random() * window.innerWidth;
            const y = Math.random() * window.innerHeight;

            p.style.left = `${x}px`;
            p.style.top = `${y}px`;

            const size = 0.6 + Math.random() * 3;
            const duration = 4 + Math.random() * 4;
            const swayX = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 60;
            const swayY = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 60;

            p.style.fontSize = `${size}rem`;
            p.style.setProperty("--sway-x", `${swayX}px`);
            p.style.setProperty("--sway-y", `${swayY}px`);
            p.style.setProperty("--rot", `${Math.random() * 360}deg`);
            p.style.animationDuration = `${duration}s`;

            document.body.appendChild(p);
            created++;

            setTimeout(() => p.remove(), duration * 1000);
          }

          if (created >= totalParticles) {
            clearInterval(burstInterval);
          }
        }, 40);

        const mainSun = document.getElementById("main-sunflower");
        if (mainSun) {
          mainSun.style.animation = "none";
          void mainSun.offsetWidth;
          mainSun.style.animation =
            "bloom-pop 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)";
        }
      };
    }

    const specialBtn = document.getElementById("special-msg-btn");
    const overlay = document.getElementById("special-overlay");
    const closeBtn = document.getElementById("close-overlay");

    if (specialBtn && overlay && closeBtn) {
      specialBtn.onclick = () => {
        overlay.classList.add("is-active");
      };
      closeBtn.onclick = (e) => {
        e.stopPropagation();
        overlay.classList.remove("is-active");
      };
      overlay.onclick = () => {
        overlay.classList.remove("is-active");
      };
    }

    const reasonsBtn = document.getElementById("reasons-btn");
    const reasonsOverlay = document.getElementById("reasons-overlay");
    const closeReasonsBtn = document.getElementById("close-reasons");

    if (reasonsBtn && reasonsOverlay && closeReasonsBtn) {
      reasonsBtn.onclick = () => {
        reasonsOverlay.classList.add("is-active");
      };
      closeReasonsBtn.onclick = (e) => {
        e.stopPropagation();
        reasonsOverlay.classList.remove("is-active");
      };
    }
  }

  updateContent();
  setInterval(updateContent, 1000 * 60 * 15);
</script>

<style>
  .card-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: min(600px, calc(100vw - 2rem));
    background: rgba(12, 8, 4, 0.4);
    backdrop-filter: blur(32px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(32px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.15);
    border-radius: 2.5rem;
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    box-shadow:
      0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
      inset 0 0 20px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.05);
    animation: card-enter 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .card-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 2.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2),
      transparent 40%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  @keyframes card-enter {
    0% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(30px) scale(0.95);
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    }
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .sunflower-icon {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 4rem);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 15px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.5));
    animation: rotate-sway 6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes rotate-sway {
    0%,
    100% {
      transform: rotate(-5deg) scale(1);
    }
    50% {
      transform: rotate(5deg) scale(1.05);
    }
  }

  @keyframes bloom-pop {
    0% {
      transform: scale(1);
    }
    50% {
      transform: scale(1.3);
      filter: brightness(1.5) drop-shadow(0 0 20px #fbbf24);
    }
    100% {
      transform: scale(1);
    }
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.4em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sunflower);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .message-block {
    position: relative;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .message-text {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.6rem);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 1rem;
    min-height: 6em;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .card-footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.1);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  .divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    width: 60%;
  }

  .divider-line {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent,
      rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4),
      transparent
    );
  }

  .divider-sun {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--sunflower);
  }

  .date-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: capitalize;
  }

  .day-counter {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--sunflower-light);
  }

  .signature {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .button-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .bloom-button {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sunflower), var(--amber));
    border: none;
    border-radius: 100px;
    padding: 0.8rem 2.5rem;
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.3);
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
  }

  .bloom-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.05);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4);
  }

  .bloom-button:active {
    transform: translateY(0) scale(0.95);
  }

  .reasons-btn {
    background: rgba(12, 8, 4, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4);
    color: var(--sunflower-light);
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .reasons-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.15);
    transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2);
  }

  .special-link {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-decoration: underline;
    cursor: pointer;
    opacity: 0.7;
    transition: opacity 0.3s;
  }

  .special-link:hover {
    opacity: 1;
    color: var(--sunflower);
  }
</style>

<style is:global>
  .bloom-petal {
    position: fixed;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 10000;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.5));
    will-change: transform, opacity;
    animation: garden-bloom ease-in-out forwards;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0);
    line-height: 1;
    user-select: none;
  }

  @keyframes garden-bloom {
    0% {
      transform: translate3d(-50%, -50%, 0) scale(0) rotate(-45deg);
      opacity: 0;
    }
    15% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translate3d(-50%, -50%, 0) scale(1.1) rotate(15deg);
    }
    30%,
    80% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translate3d(
          calc(-50% + var(--sway-x)),
          calc(-50% + var(--sway-y)),
          0
        )
        scale(1) rotate(var(--rot));
    }
    100% {
      transform: translate3d(
          calc(-50% + var(--sway-x) * 1.5),
          calc(-50% + var(--sway-y) * 1.5),
          0
        )
        scale(0) rotate(calc(var(--rot) + 90deg));
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  .reasons-overlay {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(7, 5, 2, 0.95);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 1000;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .reasons-overlay.is-active {
    opacity: 1;
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .reasons-content {
    position: relative;
    width: min(800px, calc(100vw - 2rem));
    height: calc(100vh - 4rem);
    background: rgba(12, 8, 4, 0.6);
    backdrop-filter: blur(40px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(40px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.25);
    border-radius: 4rem;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    box-shadow:
      0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),
      inset 0 0 30px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.05);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transform: translateY(40px) scale(0.95);
    transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .reasons-overlay.is-active .reasons-content {
    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
  }

  .reasons-title {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    color: var(--sunflower);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: italic;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.3);
  }

  .reasons-scroll {
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding-right: 1rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
    scrollbar-width: thin;
    scrollbar-color: var(--sunflower) transparent;
  }

  .reasons-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar {
    width: 6px;
  }

  .reasons-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
    background: transparent;
  }

  .reasons-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background-color: var(--sunflower);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .reasons-scroll p {
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 300;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
  }

  .reasons-overlay.is-active .reasons-scroll p,
  .reasons-overlay.is-active .reasons-scroll .reasons-separator {
    animation: fade-up-reasons 0.8s ease forwards;
  }

  @keyframes fade-up-reasons {
    to {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(1) {
    animation-delay: 0.3s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(2) {
    animation-delay: 0.5s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(3) {
    animation-delay: 0.7s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(4) {
    animation-delay: 0.9s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(5) {
    animation-delay: 1.1s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(6) {
    animation-delay: 1.3s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(7) {
    animation-delay: 1.5s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(8) {
    animation-delay: 1.7s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(9) {
    animation-delay: 1.9s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(10) {
    animation-delay: 2.1s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(11) {
    animation-delay: 2.3s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(12) {
    animation-delay: 2.5s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(13) {
    animation-delay: 2.7s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(14) {
    animation-delay: 2.9s;
  }
  .reasons-scroll > *:nth-child(15) {
    animation-delay: 3.1s;
  }

  .reasons-separator {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    opacity: 0;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4));
    transform: translateY(20px);
  }

  .reasons-ending {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif !important;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2rem) !important;
    color: var(--sunflower-light) !important;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 3rem !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .reasons-overlay.is-active .reasons-ending {
    animation: fade-up-ending 1s ease forwards;
    animation-delay: 3.3s;
  }

  @keyframes fade-up-ending {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .special-overlay {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 1000;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
  }

  .special-overlay.is-active {
    opacity: 1;
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .overlay-content {
    position: relative;
    width: min(500px, calc(100vw - 2rem));
    background: rgba(12, 8, 4, 0.5);
    backdrop-filter: blur(40px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(40px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.25);
    border-radius: 4rem;
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    box-shadow:
      0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
      inset 0 0 20px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.1);
    text-align: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .overlay-text {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #fff;
    max-width: 400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .close-button {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1rem;
    right: 1.5rem;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: var(--sunflower, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.8));
    font-size: 2rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .close-button:hover {
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .card-wrapper {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 2rem;
    }
    .reasons-content,
    .overlay-content {
      border-radius: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
